                //    Main FBO (FBO1):                  Main_Color         + Main_DepthStencil
                //    Invert classification FBO (FBO2): Invert_Color       + Invert_DepthStencil
                //    IsClassified FBO (FBO3):          IsClassified_Color + Invert_DepthStencil
                //
